type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"><h2><strong>Wall Fountains That Bring Movement and Style to Your Space – Midwest Tropical</strong></h2><p>Wall fountains are a great way to add beauty and calm to any room. At Midwest Tropical, we design and build fountains that suit your space and style. We have decorated lobbies, offices, hotels, and even large living rooms. And every time, we have added a peaceful, eye-catching feature for our clients’ spaces.</p><p>Our team creates large wall fountains that are perfect for tall spaces or wide feature walls. These fountains become a focal point that draws people in and makes your space feel more relaxing. Our clients have voiced that the sound of flowing water helped reduce stress and blocked out unwanted noise in their spaces.</p><p>Furthermore, we offer full customization for every wall fountain. You can choose materials like glass, acrylic, or metal. You can also select lighting, colors, and water patterns. If you need a company logo or brand design added, we can do that, too.</p><p>With over 40 years of experience, Midwest Tropical knows how to take your ideas and turn them into something special. Let us help you create a fountain that fits your vision and brings your walls to life. <br />Don’t hesitate to reach out to us for discussion.</p></div></div></div><div class="elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-2871c3d5" data-id="2871c3d5" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column"><div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2193914 elementor-button-align-stretch elementor-widget elementor-widget-form" data-id="2193914" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;step_next_label&quot;:&quot;Next&quot;,&quot;step_previous_label&quot;:&quot;Previous&quot;,&quot;button_width&quot;:&quot;100&quot;,&quot;step_type&quot;:&quot;number_text&quot;,&quot;step_icon_shape&qu