ncoln-Park-Institute-Chicago-IL-black-scored-acrylic-water-wall-1-1-scaled-1024x1726.jpg.webp 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/Water-Wall-Lincoln-Park-Institute-Chicago-IL-black-scored-acrylic-water-wall-1-1-scaled-1280x2157.jpg.webp 1280w, /wp-content/uploads/Water-Wall-Lincoln-Park-Institute-Chicago-IL-black-scored-acrylic-water-wall-1-1-1440x1440.jpg.webp 1440w, /wp-content/uploads/Water-Wall-Lincoln-Park-Institute-Chicago-IL-black-scored-acrylic-water-wall-1-1-scaled.jpg.webp 1519w" sizes="(max-width: 1519px) 100vw, 1519px" title="Wall Fountain 2"></picture></div></div></div><div class="elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-2746b32" data-id="2746b32" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column"><div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated"><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-20d0a3d2 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="20d0a3d2" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default"><h2><strong>Wall Mounted and Modern Wall Fountain Options for Every Space</strong></h2><p>If you&#8217;re working with limited floor space or just want something clean and elegant, a wall mounted fountain is a smart choice we always recommend to our clients. It sits directly on the wall and adds movement without getting in the way. We design wall-mounted features that work well in both small and large spaces.</p><p>We do custom and can suggest modern wall fountain designs as required by our clients. We make sure that our completed wall fountains are sleek, simple, and built for today’s interiors. We work with designers and business owners to create pieces that look great and perform well over time. You can pick from vertical or horizontal layouts, and we’ll help you find the right look for your space.</p><p>We build every fountain in-house and test it before it leaves our facility. That way, you know you&#8217;re getting something reliable and built to last. Whether you are looking to invest in a peaceful element to a reception area or bringing texture to a long hallway, our modern designs will get the job done – guaranteed. You share your vision. We’ll build the wall fountain that brings it to life.</p><h3><strong>Why Choose Midwest Tropical?</strong></h3><p>We build long-lasting, one-of-a-kind pieces that add value to your space. Our work has been trusted by clients across industries for more than four decades. From hospitality to healthcare, retail to residential, we’ve done it all. Here’s what sets us apart:</p><ul><li>Custom work from start to finish. You choose the size, materials, and features.</li><li>Built in-house. Every wall fountain is made and tested at our own facility.</li><li>Experience you can trust. We’ve been designing water features since 1977.</li><li>Ongoing support. We’re here even after your fountain is installed.</li></ul><p>We care about details and timelines. When you work with us, you get personal attention and quality you can count on. That’s why so many clients come back to us for more. Contact us today and have a personalized discussion.</p></div></div></div></div></section><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-3f3ca96 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="3f3ca96" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container"><div class="e-con-inner"><h3 data-interaction-id="887133f" class="e-887133f-9382916 e-heading-base e-default-h3" data-e-type="widget" data-id="887133f">Frequently Asked Questions – FAQs.</h3><div class="elementor-element elementor-element-eb7ba0b elementor-widget elementor-widget-html" data-id="eb7ba0b" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="html.default">
