<div class="accordion"><div class="accordion-item"><button id="accordion-button-1" aria-expanded="false"><span class="accordion-title">What is the difference between a wall mounted fountain and a freestanding one?</span><span class="icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div class="accordion-content"><p>A wall mounted fountain is installed directly onto a wall. It saves space and looks seamless. Freestanding fountains sit on the ground and may take up more room.</p></div></div><div class="accordion-item"><button id="accordion-button-2" aria-expanded="false"><span class="accordion-title">Can you build large wall fountains for tall or wide spaces?</span><span class="icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div class="accordion-content"><p>Yes, we specialize in large wall fountains that fit big walls and open areas. We can help design a layout that fills your space just right.</p></div></div><div class="accordion-item"><button id="accordion-button-3" aria-expanded="false"><span class="accordion-title">How do I maintain my modern wall fountain?</span><span class="icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div class="accordion-content"><p>We provide simple instructions to keep your modern wall fountain clean and running smoothly. Most require minimal upkeep.</p></div></div><div class="accordion-item"><button id="accordion-button-4" aria-expanded="false"><span class="accordion-title">Can the fountains include logos or lighting?</span><span class="icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div class="accordion-content"><p>Absolutely. We can add company branding, backlighting, color-changing LEDs, and more to make your wall fountains stand out.</p></div></div>
